    text: "Change\r\nThe southbound 7:57 a.m. trip will change to 7:52 a.m.\r\n\nReason\r\nAccount for traffic delays due to 8:30 a.m. school start time.\r\n\nSurvey Results\r\nOut of 6 respondents, 50% reported a positive impact from the change, 50% indicated it had no impact, and 0% perceived the change negatively."
